# expect: ex:AlignedDerived bddo:DerivedFieldShape sh:SPARQLConstraintComponent
# expect: ex:PaddedDerived bddo:DerivedFieldShape sh:SPARQLConstraintComponent
# expect: ex:TypedDerived bddo:DerivedFieldShape sh:SPARQLConstraintComponent
# expect: ex:DispatchedDerived bddo:DerivedFieldShape sh:SPARQLConstraintComponent
# A derived field occupies no bytes: it has no start to align, no end to pad and no type to read.
@prefix bddo: <https://hexplain.io/ns/bddo#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix sh:   <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/derived#> .

ex:AlignedDerived a bddo:Field ; bddo:valueFromExpression "a + b" ; bddo:alignment 4 .
ex:PaddedDerived a bddo:Field ; bddo:valueFromExpression "a + b" ; bddo:padTo 8 .
ex:TypedDerived a bddo:Field ; bddo:valueFromExpression "a + b" ; bddo:dataType bddo:uint8 .
ex:DispatchedDerived a bddo:Field ; bddo:valueFromExpression "a + b" ; bddo:hasDispatchTable ex:Kinds .
ex:Kinds a bddo:DispatchTable ; bddo:dispatchOnExpression "a" .
